UID:gz-the-foundation-paddle-classic-1886372@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\nWelcome to the annual\nFoundation Paddle Classic\
 n\, presented by\nVulcan\, Inc.\n\, a premier one-day gender doubles pickl
 eball tournament! This exciting fundraising event guarantees a fantastic d
 ay of community competition\, courtside fun\, and networking—all while r
 aising vital funds to support local education.\nDesigned for players of al
 l skill levels\, this event invites teams of two to pick up a paddle and m
 ake a difference on and off the court.\nProceeds from the tournament direc
 tly benefit local education initiatives\, providing resources\, grants\, a
 nd opportunities for students and teachers in our community.\nREGISTER NOW
 \nTournament Structure & Divisions\nTo ensure fair\, highly competitive pl
 ay\, divisions will be broken down by skill and age.\nSkill Levels\nBeginn
 er\nIntermediate\nAdvanced\nAge Groups\n8–35 | 35–50 | 50–60 | 60–
 69 | 70+\nNote: Players are permitted to play down in an age bracket only.
  To ensure playable brackets\, the tournament director reserves the right 
 to combine or split age groups if necessary.\nFormat\nGender Doubles (Team
 s of 2)\nRound Robin stage followed by a Playoff bracket.\nDUPR Impact: Th
 is is a fun\, charity-focused tournament and will not affect your DUPR rat
 ing\nRegistration Details\nEntry Fee: $40 per player\nClever Pickleball Re
 gistration Platform\nImportant Rule: Please register for only one (1) even
 t.\nChanges: Need to modify your registration details after signing up? Pl
 ease contact the tournament director directly.\n\n---\n🌐 View original 
 event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/the-fo
 undation-paddle-classic-1886372
