BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Public Safety Career Fair to Connect Community with Career Opportu
 nities
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260827T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260827T140000
DTSTAMP:20260809T082849Z
UID:gz-public-safety-career-fair-to-connect-community-with-career-opportun
 ities-1879084@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\nBaldwin County 9-1-1 is excited to announce an up
 coming Public Safety Career Fair\, open to the public and designed to high
 light career opportunities in emergency services and public safety.\nThe e
 vent will be held on Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\, from 9am to 2pm at the 
 Robertsdale Coliseum. Job seekers will have the opportunity to meet repres
 entatives from several agencies across the county and the state\, includin
 g law\, fire\, EMS\, 911\, and other public safety organizations.\n“This
  job fair is a great chance for anyone interested in a career in public sa
 fety to learn more about the wide range of opportunities available\,” sa
 id Kristi Stamnes\, Baldwin County 911 Director. “Agencies are looking f
 or dedicated individuals who want to serve their communities\, and this ev
 ent provides a direct connection between candidates and employers.”\nPar
 ticipants can expect to:\n• Explore career opportunities with multiple p
 ublic safety agencies.\n• Speak directly with recruiters and hiring staf
 f.\n• Learn about the application process\, training\, and career paths 
 in public safety.\nThe Baldwin County Public Safety Career Fair is free an
 d open to all members of the public. Attendees are encouraged to bring cop
 ies of their résumés and come prepared to ask questions about career opp
 ortunities.\nEvent Details:\n📍 Location: Robertsdale Coliseum 19477 Fai
 rground Rd\, Robertsdale\, AL 36567\n📅 Date: Thursday\, August 27\, 202
 6\n⏰ Time: 9am to 2pm\nFor more information\, please contact Kristi Stam
 nes at\nkstamnes@baldwin911.org\n.\n\n---\n🌐 View original event: https
 ://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/public-safety-care
 er-fair-to-connect-community-with-career-opportunities-1879084
LOCATION:Robertsdale Coliseum\, 19477 Fairground Rd.\, Robertsdale\,\, AL\
 , 36567\, United States
END:VEVENT
