BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Walk This Way 80s 5K & Block Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260912T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260912T220000
DTSTAMP:20260809T082849Z
UID:gz-walk-this-way-80s-5k-block-party-1886398@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\nLace Up\, Dress Up & Party Like It’s 1985!\nGet
  ready to grab your neon\, tease your hair\, and break out the leg warmers
  because\nWalk This Way: 80’s 5K & Block Party\nis bringing the ultimate
  throwback experience to Downtown Foley!  This high-energy\, 80s-themed e
 vent combines a fun and festive 5K with an unforgettable block party\, all
  while supporting local education initiatives through the South Baldwin Ch
 amber Foundation.\nWhether you’re running\, walking\, skating\, or simpl
 y showing up for the music and nostalgia\, this is your chance to celebrat
 e the decade of mixtapes\, mullets\, and moonwalks in totally tubular styl
 e.\nPURCHASE TICKETS HERE\nThe 80’s 5K\nParticipants will take on a scen
 ic 5K course winding through Historic Downtown Foley and the beautiful Ros
 e Trail before crossing the finish line at Heritage Park.\nCostumes are hi
 ghly encouraged! Dust off your windbreakers\, rock your brightest neon\, c
 hannel your favorite 80s icon\, and bring the energy from start to finish.
 \nWhether you’re chasing a personal best or just cruising with friends\,
  this event is all about having fun and embracing the spirit of the decade
 .\nThe Block Party\nFollowing the race\, Heritage Park transforms into the
  ultimate 80s celebration\, with an epic Block Party featuring a live 80s 
 cover band\, Disco Kiss\, and special guest 80's Condo Queen Kylee Kubat\,
  turning the finish line into a full-scale throwback with music\, dancing\
 , and nonstop fun. Bring your friends\, relive the glory days\, and celebr
 ate under the lights as we turn Heritage Park into a retro party destinati
 on.\nBYOB Friendly\nParticipants and guests are welcome to bring their own
  beverages to enjoy during the block party\, provided they comply with eve
 nt guidelines and local regulations.\nFood will be available for purchase 
 from a variety of food truck vendors throughout the evening.\nNot a Runner
 ? Join the Party Anyway!\nWant all the fun without the 5K? Block Party Onl
 y Tickets are available for those who want to skip the race and head strai
 ght to the celebration. Because let’s be honest—not everyone wants to 
 run\, but everyone deserves a good party.\n\n---\n🌐 View original event
 : https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/walk-this-w
 ay-80s-5k-block-party-1886398
LOCATION:Foley Heritage Park\, Foley\,\, AL\, 36535\, United States
END:VEVENT
